    sequence: ['Discover complete impacted project set without acquiring a partial set of locks; sorted project UUID locks; rediscover and restart on new scope', 'Lock head/baseline/contract/receipt and all source-family/source/cost/F governance rows in shared deterministic order; assert all versions and expectedInputHash', 'Apply real receipt certification/labor/allocation correction producer calls only when explicitly requested and authorized; persist explicit classifications; CAS direct cost included transition; preserve actual source-state before/after proof', 'Allocate target snapshot/context UUIDs server-side; collect exact post-producer immutable context and sourceRows; calculate exact primary facts; H pure derive owns action/readiness', 'Reject formalEligibility missing-evidence; write G source context/members and snapshot with final action once at captured row version 1', 'For period: write paired period anchor with exactly same source context; for restatement: append restatement+causal links and metadata-only old terminal supersede', 'H evaluate reloads real new context/hash/v1, recomputes/asserts final facts/action and writes DMER/OSER/four binding/summary chains; no G facts writeback', 'CAS project_operating_head/new period terminal pointers, required business audit/security/auth coflush, one outer COMMIT; any necessary write failure rolls back all'] },
  baselineOnlySequence: 'activateOperatingBaselinePackage validates only adopted estimate/approved transition/handover provenance and freezes operating_baseline_source; it does not require receipts/cost classifications or create a fake ProjectOperatingSnapshot/H evaluation. Its sourceContextId is a baseline evidence ID, not an OperatingSourceContext row. Snapshot creation separately applies the full G/H pipeline.',
  baselineAmounts: 'originalBaselineCost = earliest formally adopted PROJECT estimate net; handoverBaselineCost = exact adopted handover effective project estimate net (or original when no absorbed rebaseline); executionChangePackageTotal = sum approved post-execution successor net minus predecessor net once each; changePackageTotal compatibility = handoverBaselineCost-originalBaselineCost+executionChangePackageTotal; currentEffectiveBaselineCost=handoverBaselineCost+executionChangePackageTotal. Keep all components distinct in source payload/UI; original never overwritten.',
